          },
          "off"
        ]
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "Flash-Next 稳定档关闭推测解码",
        "en": "Flash-Next stable recipe keeps speculative decoding off"
      },
      "message": {
        "zh": "当前已验证的 262K SGLang 档未启用 MTP/DSpark；请先使用 off，避免把未验证变量带入长上下文服务。",
        "en": "The validated 262K SGLang recipe runs without MTP/DSpark; use off so no unverified variable enters the long-context service."
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "rule",
      "severity": "warn",
      "code": "flashnext_thinking_tool_parser",
      "when": {
        "and": [
          {
            "ne": [
              {
                "user": "reasoning.defaultEnabled"
              },
              false
            ]
          },
          {
            "eq": [
              {
                "coalesce": [
                  {
                    "user": "toolCallParser"
                  },
                  "qwen3_coder"
                ]
              },
              "qwen3_coder"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "Thinking + qwen3_coder 风险",
        "en": "Thinking with qwen3_coder is risky"
      },
      "message": {
        "zh": "当前上游仍有 token-0 循环问题；建议勾选“默认关闭 thinking”，客户端确有需要时再逐请求开启。",
        "en": "Upstream still has a token-0 loop issue; turn thinking off by default and enable it per request when a client needs it."
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "rule",
      "severity": "warn",
      "code": "flashnext_custom_image",
      "when": {
        "and": [
          {
            "isSet": {
              "user": "runtimeImage"
            }
          },
          {
            "ne": [
              {
                "fact": "runtime.id"
              },
              "sglang@qwen38flashnext-sm120-dac5523d"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "自定义 Flash-Next 镜像",
        "en": "Custom Flash-Next image"
      },
      "message": {
        "zh": "当前只验证了 {{recipe.runtimeImage}}；自定义镜像必须确认含完整 SM120 QSA 修复。",
        "en": "Only {{recipe.runtimeImage}} is validated; a custom image must include the full SM120 QSA fix."
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "rule",
      "severity": "warn",
      "code": "flashnext_mamba_cache_extreme_context",
      "when": {
        "and": [
          {
            "gte": [
              {
                "coalesce": [
                  {
                    "user": "contextLength"
                  },
                  0
                ]
              },
              229492
            ]
          },
          {
            "gt": [
              {
                "coalesce": [
                  {
                    "user": "sglang.maxMambaCacheSize"
                  },
                  8
                ]
              },
              8
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "极限上下文 Mamba cache 风险",
        "en": "Mamba cache risk at extreme context"
      },
      "message": {
        "zh": "本机 max Mamba cache 24 在 229K 输入最后一个 prefill chunk OOM；262K 档请保持 8，较大值只用于单独的短上下文并发 A/B。",
        "en": "A max Mamba cache of 24 ran out of memory on the last prefill chunk of a 229K input; keep 8 for the 262K recipe and use larger values only for separate short-context concurrency A/B runs."
      }
    }
